===Notes===
*The flee chance isn't random as the description states. Each time the target acts, the chance is added to a hidden counter (only half if the creature passes a mental save against your Mindpower). Whenever the counter rolls over 100 the creature attempts to flee on its turn. The counter starts randomly between 0 and 100, so the first flee comes at a random time and later ones follow a roughly regular rhythm. {{t|Beckon}} and the Paranoid fear from {{t|Instill Fear}} use the same counter.